        <div>
            <section class="section section--ivory section--lazy" id="tieups">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="section__head reveal">
                        <h2 class="section__title">Tie-ups</h2>
                        <p class="section__lead">Partners who bring learning, sport and culture right into the township.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="slider slider--1 slider--overlay" data-slider>
                        <div class="slider__track" tabindex="0" aria-label="Partners">
                            <article class="slider__item partner">
                                <div class="partner__media partner__media--portrait"><img
                                        src="assets/img/sureshnew.webp" alt="Suresh Wadkar" width="400" height="550"
                                        loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="partner__logo"><img src="assets/img/tieups/sureshlogo.webp"
                                            alt="Ajivasan Music Academy" width="185" height="121" loading="lazy"></div>
                                    <h3 class="partner__name">Suresh Wadkar’s Ajivasan Music Academy</h3>
                                    <p class="partner__text">Ajivasan has been spreading the message of Hindustani
                                        Classical Music to thousands of students for 86 years. It has been Ajivasan’s
                                        continuous endeavour to educate and spread Hindustani Music, Culture &amp; Art
                                        across society. The students have had the opportunity to perform with the master
                                        himself on several occasions. Ajivasan offers varied Music Appreciation Courses
                                        for children, adults and youth, with practical and scientific methods that widen
                                        an individual’s ability to use their potential to 100%. These classes will be
                                        conducted in Dosti West County for Indian and Western vocal and instrument
                                        training.</p>
                                    <p class="partner__text note">Residents will be able to avail of this facility on
                                        payment of the applicable fee once the classes commence.</p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                            <article class="slider__item partner">
                                <div class="partner__media"><img src="assets/img/tieups/euroschool.webp"
                                        alt="EuroSchool campus rendering" width="700" height="472" loading="lazy"
                                        decoding="async"></div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="partner__logo"><img src="assets/img/tieups/eurologo.webp"
                                            alt="EuroSchool" width="400" height="289" loading="lazy"></div>
                                    <h3 class="partner__name">EuroSchool</h3>
                                    <p class="partner__text">EuroSchool constantly endeavours to nurture aspirations and
                                        curiosity in their students’ journey of self-discovery. They encourage students
                                        to explore several possibilities, help them discover their passions and hone the
                                        same. It is this common belief that inspires them to collaborate with
                                        like-minded partners to bring in world-class schooling. They blend Balanced
                                        Schooling pedagogy with the Learn–Reinforce–Practice–Apply–Experience
                                        methodology, paving the way for students to excel in academics while
                                        co-curricular activities shape their creative, sporting and musical aspirations.
                                    </p>
                                    <p class="partner__text">The student-centric blended learning practices include:
                                        National Education Policy (NEP) 2020 powered curriculum, an industry-best
                                        digital learning ecosystem powered by ARGUS, highly trained teachers, and
                                        EuroBridge, a preparatory course for toddlers for the new academic year.
                                        EuroSchool is also India’s 1st chain of schools to receive the ‘safe school’
                                        certification from a global audit firm.</p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                            <article class="slider__item partner">
                                <div class="partner__media"><img src="assets/img/badminton-ame.webp"
                                        alt="Badminton court" width="800" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                                </div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="partner__logo"><img src="assets/img/tieups/badmitonpro.webp"
                                            alt="Badminton Pros" width="400" height="98" loading="lazy"></div>
                                    <h3 class="partner__name">Badminton Pros</h3>
                                    <p class="partner__text">Badminton Pros, powered by the legendary Saina Nehwal, is a
                                        premier coaching academy dedicated to nurturing the next generation of badminton
                                        champions. Led by Head Coach Vijay Lancy, a renowned name in the badminton
                                        coaching fraternity, the academy boasts a team of experienced mentors, including
                                        Commonwealth Gold Medallist Parupalli Kashyap and RMV Gurusai Dutt. With a focus
                                        on holistic development and personalised attention, Badminton Pros provides a
                                        comprehensive training programme that helps players improve their technique,
                                        strategy and mental toughness. By leveraging the expertise of India’s badminton
                                        icons, Badminton Pros aims to revolutionise the sport and produce world-class
                                        players who can make India proud on the global stage.</p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                            <article class="slider__item partner">
                                <div class="partner__media"><img src="assets/img/club-ame.webp"
                                        alt="Ileseum Club facilities" width="800" height="480" loading="lazy"
                                        decoding="async"></div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="partner__logo"><img src="assets/img/tieups/ilesumclub.webp"
                                            alt="Ileseum Club" width="400" height="125" loading="lazy"></div>
                                    <h3 class="partner__name">Ileseum Club</h3>
                                    <p class="partner__text">Ileseum Clubs are a chain of premier sports and leisure
                                        facilities dedicated to providing exceptional amenities and services to their
                                        members. With a focus on inclusivity, accessibility and excellence, Ileseum
                                        Clubs offer a unique blend of sports, fitness and social experiences. Their
                                        state-of-the-art facilities, expert staff and carefully curated programmes
                                        create a welcoming environment for individuals of all ages and skill levels,
                                        fostering a community that celebrates active living, wellness and connection.
                                        With an impressive portfolio of 18 brands, Ileseum Clubs have established
                                        themselves as a leader in the sports and leisure industry. Ileseum currently
                                        operates 7 locations across India, with several more in development. From
                                        professional training to recreational activities, Ileseum Clubs cater to a
                                        diverse range of interests and needs.</p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                            <article class="slider__item partner">
                                <div class="partner__media"><img src="assets/img/saurav.webp" alt="Saurav Ghosal"
                                        width="800" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
                                <div>
                                    <div class="partner__logo"><img src="assets/img/tieups/squashlogo.webp"
                                            alt="Saurav Ghosal Squash" width="115" height="361" loading="lazy"
                                            style="max-height:80px"></div>
                                    <h3 class="partner__name">Saurav Ghosal Squash (SGS)</h3>
                                    <p class="partner__text">Saurav Ghosal Squash (SGS) is a premier training
                                        destination founded by India’s squash legend, Saurav Ghosal, in partnership with
                                        Hotfut. Designed to inspire and develop athletes at all levels, SGS offers
                                        world-class coaching programmes that emphasise technical precision, strategic
                                        gameplay, physical conditioning and mental resilience. The academy is committed
                                        to a holistic approach, nurturing not just champions on the court but
                                        well-rounded individuals off it. With state-of-the-art facilities and a
                                        passionate team of experienced coaches, SGS is redefining the future of squash
                                        and making it accessible and engaging for everyone.</p>
                                    <p class="partner__text note">Residents will be able to avail of this facility on
                                        payment of the applicable fee.</p>
                                </div>
